.SH NAME
le-text - Transform UTF-8 stdin or generate portable text


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle text [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Transform UTF-8 text from stdin and write the result to stdout.
Each input and output is limited to 1 MiB; JSON nesting is limited to 128.
Invalid input produces no partial result. These tools never use the clipboard.
Scalar values and reports end in LF; content transforms preserve their content.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for text


